  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s1",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was admitted to the orthopedic surgery service and \nwas taken to the operating room for above described procedure.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2163-2289",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s2",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Please see separately dictated operative report for details.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2291-2351",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgery was uncomplicated and the patient tolerated the \nprocedure well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2352-2429",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Patient received perioperative IV antibiotics.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2430-2476",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Postoperative course was remarkable for the following:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2478-2532",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "1.)POD#0, oliguria->500cc LR bolus, increased maintenance fluids",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2534-2598",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s7",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "80->100 with good effect.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2600-2625",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "2.)POD#2, failed to void, straight cath x 1, void trial repeated \nand successful.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2627-2708",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Otherwise, pain was initially controlled with a PCA followed by \na transition to oral pain medications on POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2710-2822",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient \nreceived lovenox for DVT prophylaxis starting on the morning of",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2824-2900",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "POD#1.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2902-2908",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The foley was removed on POD#2 and failed initial void \ntrial, but successful void trial the following day on POD#3, \nthen the patient was voiding independently thereafter.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=2910-3082",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The \nsurgical dressing was changed on POD#2 and the surgical incision \nwas found to be clean and intact without erythema or abnormal \ndrainage.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3083-3226",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was seen daily by physical therapy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3227-3274",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s15",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Labs \nwere checked throughout the hospital course and repleted \naccordingly.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3275-3351",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "At the time of discharge the patient was tolerating \na regular diet and feeling well.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3352-3437",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient was afebrile with \nstable vital signs.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3439-3489",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "The patient's hematocrit was acceptable and \npain was adequately controlled on an oral regimen.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=16447846-DS-10:chars=3491-3586",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
